  "question": {
    "text": "The greatest and least values of $f(x)=\\tan ^{-1} x-\\frac{1}{2} \\ln x$ on $\\left[\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}, \\sqrt{3}\\right]$ are",
    "image": null
  },
